                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The emergent actual occasion from which value is abstracted."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3c469c9-5022-4918-b7b8-4404b38ea448",
                                                "sense_id": "2b7ef211-4f90-330f-983e-1646902f3a0b",
                                                "text": "Thus the eternal relatedness is of the form — the είδος —; the emergent actual occasion is the superject of informed value; value, as abstracted from any particular superject, is the abstract matter — the ϋλη — which is common to all actual occasions and the synthetic activity which prehends valueless possibility into superjicient informed value is the substantial activity."
                                            }
                                        ]
